          "type": "text",
          "text": "Implementation guide written to `docs/plans/ISS-59_m4_anthropic_streaming_implement.md`.\n\n**Summary:** 19 tasks across 9 groups, all sequential. The guide covers:\n\n1. **Wire format types** — streaming envelope structs + unmarshal tests\n2. **Error mapping** — `mapStreamErrorType()` for mid-stream SSE errors\n3. **`SendStream()` method** — the core implementation with closure state and SSE-to-StreamEvent mapping\n4. **Request construction tests** — stream flag, defaults, omit-empty\n5. **Pre-stream error tests** — HTTP errors, context cancellation\n6. **Text streaming tests** — full text SSE sequence\n7. **Tool call streaming tests** — tool start/delta/end sequence\n8. **Mixed block tests** — interleaved text + tool blocks\n9. **Edge case tests** — ping, mid-stream error, empty deltas, malformed JSON, unknown index, missing message_start",
